- **Client project**: `/tmp/sv-3e6a2f47c50344e685e909785e07e829/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/` — all interactive UI components

Key architecture rule: Interactive components in .Client cannot access DB directly. Data flows through HTTP APIs.

